      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{61f58914d9c92d1b0f96f27d|full_name}: I am also facing this exact same issue where everything works except one singular object despite being identical and using the same methods, and everything related/parented to that object breaks as well.\n\nAnd it's annoying because in-editor (with the client simulator) everything works as it should.\n\nSo at this point I'm starting to believe that there is nothing wrong with my scripts to begin with in the first place but still annoying there isn't any fix available currently.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
