      "value": "@{640e9d4d04e0fd4520bbdadd|full_name}:  Locally in the client sim everything works fine for me as well. Only on the live client is there an issue.  I've verified everything in my scene is as it should be.  The new live client seems to have an error in the way it unpacks/deserializes scene data which leads to unreliable behavior, perhaps related to some EAC or security change which only applies to the live client. This is really bad for map makers because this can break maps that have been out for months or years and creators will be chasing red-herrings unless this is fixed.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
